# Licenses

SteamOS-ARM-SM8550 is a Linux distribution made up of many open-source
components. Each component is provided under its own license.

## Project software

Original software and scripts developed for SteamOS-ARM-SM8550 are licensed
under the terms of the [GNU GPL Version 2](https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html).

Vendor trees keep their own licenses (Linux kernel GPL-2.0, Decky plugins
GPL-3.0-or-later, gamescope BSD-2-Clause, and others). See [`CREDITS.md`](CREDITS.md).

## Valve SteamOS and Steam

Steam, SteamOS, Steam Deck, and related marks are trademarks of Valve
Corporation. Official SteamOS userspace and the Steam client remain subject
to Valve's terms. This repository does **not** redistribute the official
SteamOS root filesystem or Steam client binaries.
